=2 Walkthrough
!Ghelsba Outpost-map1.jpg|right|Ghelsba Outpost Map
* Talk to any {n:Gate Guard} and accept the Mission.
* Next speak to {n:Arnau} in the **Cathedral** in {z:Northern San d'Oria}.
** He is the main NPC at the Altar in the Chapel section of the Cathedral.
* After the cutscene, head to {z:Ghelsba Outpost}. The entrance is located at (E-4) in {z:West Ronfaure}.
** The map for {z:Ghelsba Outpost} may be purchased for 600 {p:Gil} from either {n:Elesca} at (I-8) in {z:Northern San d'Oria} or {n:Violitte} at (G-10) in {z:Southern San d'Oria}.
* Make your way to the **Hut Door** in the large area around (G-9). The door itself is located at (F-10).
* Interact with the **Hut Door** and clear the BCNM **Save the Children**. You will obtain {@k} {k:Orcish hut key}.
** Up to 6 people are allowed into this {p:BCNM} if they are on or have completed this Mission.
** When entering the battlefield, a Level Restriction (Status) effect will be applied (level unlimited), which serves to reset TP, desummons {p:Trusts|Category:Trust}, and prevents {p:exp loss|Experience Points} if you're defeated. Trusts can be used in the battlefield: be sure to wait until your trust magic {p:Recast Time} is ready, and summon them **after** entering the battlefield but before entering combat.
** You will fight 3 {m:Orcs|Orc}.
*** {m:Fodderchief Vokdek} ({p:WAR})
*** {m:Strongarm Zodvad} ({p:RNG})
*** {m:Sureshot Snatgat} ({p:RNG})
* Interact with the **Hut Door** after clearing the BCNM for a cutscene.
* Return to a {n:Gate Guard} to complete the Mission and receive Rank 2.
** **(Optional):** There is an additional cutscene at {n:Arnau} after speaking with the {n:Gate Guard}.

